 "_doc_battle": "The battle part (battle/battle.gd, battle/battle_rules.gd): ash_battle is Ash's own side; species.<id>.battle is each Pokemon's (HP, speed, how each temper takes Ash's actions, when it flees or loses interest, its moves keyed by move id, each with a type and room for an energy cost {type: n} later). Ash has no HP: his stamina (body.gd's bar) is what a battle wears down, in points (stamina_points = a full bar). Each of his actions costs some (cost), a Pokemon's hit takes dmg points off it (a Pidgey's hit is a quarter to a third of a full bar), and nothing comes back during a battle. Moods are 0..1: anger, fear, threat. Accuracy stages work as in the games: stage s < 0 multiplies accuracy by 3 / (3 - s). The spawning and temper part of this file belongs to wild/wild.gd.",
